          "line_end": 7,
          "line_start": 3,
          "path": "docs/agent-tunnel-spec.md",
          "repository": "pchalasani/claude-code-tools",
          "url": "https://github.com/pchalasani/claude-code-tools/blob/ee0f3099c05c50141feff2559193c0af1fb81ec7/docs/agent-tunnel-spec.md#L3-L7"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_81c62470128d2740d82250c4e8e336e1df7876e7043731f15131dce8d68eea27"
      ],
      "text": "agent-tunnel exposes long-lived local Claude Code sessions ('experts') to teammates over Discord; a session is published at runtime with >share and addressed by a short handle, with each conversation answered against a read-only fork."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_f451ca94e7446318f904cc67fdc9875255560ea910e631fde566a473d91c2b0d",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "ee0f3099c05c50141feff2559193c0af1fb81ec7",
          "git_sha": "0a273e16fe9b8b8f4c953c3d5ab48f501a939160",
          "line_end": 40,
          "line_start": 19,
          "path": "docs/agent-tunnel-spec.md",
          "repository": "pchalasani/claude-code-tools",
          "url": "https://github.com/pchalasani/claude-code-tools/blob/ee0f3099c05c50141feff2559193c0af1fb81ec7/docs/agent-tunnel-spec.md#L19-L40"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_b75bb0caa1120eaf43431905e6975d4a08989f676fe89d6a7900bdf89a2a2691"
      ],
      "text": "Threads answer via --resume with --fork-session so the original session is untouched; remote turns run with --allowedTools Read,Grep,Glob, an explicit deny list, and --permission-mode dontAsk."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_6734c7ab7fedbd3bc28dc4b08fed6159d4e47ecb4b0c4cca5438973325155295",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "ee0f3099c05c50141feff2559193c0af1fb81ec7",
          "git_sha": "0a273e16fe9b8b8f4c953c3d5ab48f501a939160",
          "line_end": 40,
          "line_start": 19,
          "path": "docs/agent-tunnel-spec.md",
          "repository": "pchalasani/claude-code-tools",
          "url": "https://github.com/pchalasani/claude-code-tools/blob/ee0f3099c05c50141feff2559193c0af1fb81ec7/docs/agent-tunnel-spec.md#L19-L40"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_b75bb0caa1120eaf43431905e6975d4a08989f676fe89d6a7900bdf89a2a2691"
      ],
      "text": "agent-tunnel uses no inbound tunnel: it connects via the Discord Gateway's outbound websocket, so nothing on the machine is internet-reachable."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_1298c9ef91d5d6a6528a1bc0dba091a7b5c8f7585a7cf7bc864dd19b9e9c3a0a",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "ee0f3099c05c50141feff2559193c0af1fb81ec7",
          "git_sha": "0a273e16fe9b8b8f4c953c3d5ab48f501a939160",
          "line_end": 69,
          "line_start": 64,
          "path": "docs/agent-tunnel-spec.md",
          "repository": "pchalasani/claude-code-tools",
          "url": "https://github.com/pchalasani/claude-code-tools/blob/ee0f3099c05c50141feff2559193c0af1fb81ec7/docs/agent-tunnel-spec.md#L64-L69"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_ad5f0258052660f31edb2cfe264ec13d6229f4d418d97330c352dd1a62c1ca12"
      ],
      "text": "The >share hook (hooks/share_hook.py) is a standalone stdlib UserPromptSubmit hook that reads session_id/cwd/transcript_path from stdin, writes an fcntl-locked atomic registry, and blocks the prompt to print the handle."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_680c1219b2532e636a8881cbd2bc6fa99fdc7d8f3979fdab7f549f4eadcb6028",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "tools-permissions",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "ee0f3099c05c50141feff2559193c0af1fb81ec7",
          "git_sha": "0a273e16fe9b8b8f4c953c3d5ab48f501a939160",
          "line_end": 164,
          "line_start": 137,
          "path": "docs/agent-tunnel-spec.md",
          "repository": "pchalasani/claude-code-tools",
          "url": "https://github.com/pchalasani/claude-code-tools/blob/ee0f3099c05c50141feff2559193c0af1fb81ec7/docs/agent-tunnel-spec.md#L137-L164"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_b6210f1a07a00f9145550986974f0360113d57091e0384d32012744580a9daaa"
      ],
      "text": "Per-handle access levels: --write adds Write/Edit/NotebookEdit (never Bash); --dangerously-allow-bash adds command execution; --dangerously-skip-permissions lets the fork use any tool or MCP server the session has."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_26415cee010dbd178c9aed47a3f9bdf242cbc1dc0c83f79206572dc9adfd382f",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "ee0f3099c05c50141feff2559193c0af1fb81ec7",
          "git_sha": "0a273e16fe9b8b8f4c953c3d5ab48f501a939160",
          "line_end": 181,
          "line_start": 168,
          "path": "docs/agent-tunnel-spec.md",
          "repository": "pchalasani/claude-code-tools",
          "url": "https://github.com/pchalasani/claude-code-tools/blob/ee0f3099c05c50141feff2559193c0af1fb81ec7/docs/agent-tunnel-spec.md#L168-L181"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_ce4573cdb7b59defa21e65bd7123570eaebe43acb30608c6334971dfa09a5e48"
      ],
      "text": "In a watched channel, '<handle> [question]' opens a Discord thread bound to that session with follow-ups staying in the thread; !list/!handles list active handles; !done/!close/!end tear down the fork immediately."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_adc7f9e1fbae4d3131568fe08021103e58bf45cd72c7ee4b5bdb90cd9e9a1f14",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "ee0f3099c05c50141feff2559193c0af1fb81ec7",
          "git_sha": "0a273e16fe9b8b8f4c953c3d5ab48f501a939160",
          "line_end": 196,
          "line_start": 188,
          "path": "docs/agent-tunnel-spec.md",
          "repository": "pchalasani/claude-code-tools",
          "url": "https://github.com/pchalasani/claude-code-tools/blob/ee0f3099c05c50141feff2559193c0af1fb81ec7/docs/agent-tunnel-spec.md#L188-L196"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_cca8c6efde4f1a7cb3331af853bcfb823feaf915b17ac324355a89940e6b4255"
      ],
      "text": "Inbound attachments are downloaded to a per-thread uploads dir outside any repo and exposed to the fork via --add-dir, with per-file size and count caps; oversized or excess files are skipped with a notice."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_8e547980325ffe280d0dbc15b900bee6c6c1a316fe50316f3e5eeef9fc5e50e2",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "dependencies",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "ee0f3099c05c50141feff2559193c0af1fb81ec7",
          "git_sha": "0a273e16fe9b8b8f4c953c3d5ab48f501a939160",
          "line_end": 205,
          "line_start": 198,
          "path": "docs/agent-tunnel-spec.md",
          "repository": "pchalasani/claude-code-tools",
          "url": "https://github.com/pchalasani/claude-code-tools/blob/ee0f3099c05c50141feff2559193c0af1fb81ec7/docs/agent-tunnel-spec.md#L198-L205"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_b8bd7ed4c6222158922875a99f11d7b1764df77c8020617f8c022edb92c4f8ec"
      ],
      "text": "Binary Office attachments are best-effort converted using whatever converter is on PATH (LibreOffice→PDF preferred, else pandoc→Markdown, else macOS textutil); no converter is a hard dependency, and PDF/images/text work unaided."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_672792543a29b3a6dc03c2bac185826b610c4c791a586907f87e34a8ca5eb465",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "components",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "ee0f3099c05c50141feff2559193c0af1fb81ec7",
          "git_sha": "0a273e16fe9b8b8f4c953c3d5ab48f501a939160",
          "line_end": 215,
          "line_start": 207,
          "path": "docs/agent-tunnel-spec.md",
          "repository": "pchalasani/claude-code-tools",
          "url": "https://github.com/pchalasani/claude-code-tools/blob/ee0f3099c05c50141feff2559193c0af1fb81ec7/docs/agent-tunnel-spec.md#L207-L215"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_1c220df1e198c3bbebd671ae2df8bcc712e156d22123aa0c97241601a35c9f21"
      ],
      "text": "Write/bash forks save deliverables to .agent-tunnel-out/<thread>/; the bot snapshots and diffs that dir to post new or modified files as Discord attachments, and a wildcard .gitignore keeps deliverables out of git status."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_53b690b8c997afefeb80c402807cd315948bf5e822d89fdbc86be2c518184484",
