        "slc_815d12e93c1c5e9a393c45a8b9b1c08c59ca81155c169442db1c222af8b54cde"
      ],
      "text": "The config dir is propagated end to end: the hook derives it from transcript_path and records it in the registry, and the daemon pins each fork via CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR so work and personal sessions fork under their own config/account."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_56f7787c1dcb25553bcdf1dbe3b58d0caaebd513078f45089da8ab348e1e9fda",
